      "message": "For an offline discussion, Jiakai I would also like your thoughts on if we could consider defining them at the top-level prebuilt apex or prebuilt sccp_fragment. We would eventually like to remove these shim java_imports out of the module sdk b/320711431. Something like\n```\nprebuilt_apex {\n   name: \"com.android.foo\",\n   exported_sscp_fragments: [\"foo-sscp-fragment\"],\n}\nprebuilt_sscp_fragment {\n   name: \"foo-sscp-fragment\",\n   contents: [\"service-foo\"], # unguided\n   dexpreopt_profile_guided_contents: [\"service-bar\"], # use service-bar.jar.prof to guide optimization\n}\n```",
